OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer sacked for 'reckless'
OL,4,Aabuse case handling
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincolnshire Police officer with more
OL,7,Fthan 20 years' service has been
OL,8,Fdismissed without notice after a
OL,9,Fmisconduct panel found he took a
OL,10,F"seriously reckless" approach to a
OL,11,Fdomestic abuse case.
OL,13,FThe officer, known only as Officer A
OL,14,Fdue to reporting restrictions, advised
OL,15,Fa man how to avoid detection while
OL,16,Fbreaching a domestic violence
OL,17,Fprotection notice (DVPN) that barred
OL,18,Fhim from contacting his partner.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
