OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer sacked for 'reckless'
OL,4,Aabuse case handling
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hearing, held at the force's
OL,7,FNettleham headquarters, heard the
OL,8,Fofficer had failed to take positive
OL,9,Fsteps to protect an individual.
OL,11,FChief Constable Paul Gibson said:
OL,12,F"Officer A didn't intend harm to come
OL,13,Fto the victim but had failed to regard
OL,14,Fthe serious history of incidents."
